# Spec 039, Phase 7 (T081, FR-031): every non-GI visual and parity scene, rendered under each
# orender configuration and required to be bit-identical across them (see add_determinism_sweep()
# in CMakeLists.txt for the configurations, the forced sampler and the dither handling).
#
# The set is the scenes under examples/rib that the visual, parity and csg tests render, one
# entry per scene file with every output its Displays write. A scene appears once however many
# tests render it. Scenes that only the unit and imager tests render, the perf-only copies
# under specs/039-sampling-foundation/tools/perf, the generated Phase 6 probes in the build
# tree (SamplingJitDeterminism_* and Sampling_ThreadSweep_* cover those) and the scenes of
# DeterminismHarness_* (the harness checks itself) are not part of it.
#
# GI scenes are not swept: the irradiance cache (occlusion(), indirectdiffuse()) and the photon
# map are filled in the order the points happen to be shaded in. Spec 040 makes them
# deterministic; until then they are not asked to be. They are listed below as comments.
#
# A scene that sets its own non-zero-dither Quantize would be listed for the Phase 9 run (T103)
# only, because the dither is libc rand() until T095. None does today.

